{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make takoyaki on the Steam! Use your utensils well to make delicious takoyaki! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with up to four players! Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Score Attack]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.poster.avif?t=1771462523\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.webm?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.mp4?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for 1st place on the leaderboards by making as much takoyaki as possible! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.poster.avif?t=1771462523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.webm?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.mp4?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your takoyaki-making mettle against others!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aHow to Play\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Fill the holes with batter and ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once the takoyaki start to smoke, flip them over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   If you're too fast or too slow, it's a flop! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Once both sides are well cooked, finish by placing your takoyaki in the box!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716720?t=1771462523","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716720?t=1771462523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771462523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771462523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make takoyaki on the Steam! Use your utensils well to make delicious takoyaki! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with up to four players! Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Score Attack]</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.poster.avif?t=1771462523\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.webm?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/11d2c8585d37f1e72542829a7a2aad8b.mp4?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for 1st place on the leaderboards by making as much takoyaki as possible! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.poster.avif?t=1771462523\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.webm?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/extras/729991f62e53d176642fcd34d187f275.mp4?t=1771462523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your takoyaki-making mettle against others!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300aHow to Play\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Fill the holes with batter and ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once the takoyaki start to smoke, flip them over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   If you're too fast or too slow, it's a flop! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Once both sides are well cooked, finish by placing your takoyaki in the box!</p>","developers":["SAT-BOX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716720/header.jpg?t=1771462523","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 SAT-BOX. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2716720/1847290578/36ce03bbee3cf1f90254aefe5369d781b7cc